[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9242.19, "timestamp": "02:34:02", "text": "“嗯？”我当时就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9244.95, "timestamp": "02:34:04", "text": "我在想如果我喜欢会发生什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9246.19, "timestamp": "02:34:06", "text": "你说的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9248.95, "timestamp": "02:34:08", "text": "不。比如说，为什么“nigger”这个词这么糟糕？什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9251.83, "timestamp": "02:34:11", "text": "如果我那样做会发生什么？我想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9256.63, "timestamp": "02:34:16", "text": "知道就像运动员听着一样，那个n开头的词是不好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9259.83, "timestamp": "02:34:19", "text": "因为它具有历史内涵"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9262.389, "timestamp": "02:34:22", "text": "没错"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9266.07, "timestamp": "02:34:26", "text": "你知道“nigger”这个词背后的历史吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9269.95, "timestamp": "02:34:29", "text": "我觉得不多，就是这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9272.87, "timestamp": "02:34:32", "text": "呃，忘了是哪个国家了，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9276.23, "timestamp": "02:34:36", "text": "奴隶制相关的东西，对，美国奴隶制相关的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9280.23, "timestamp": "02:34:40", "text": "对，黑人就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9282.87, "timestamp": "02:34:42", "text": "nword曾被用来指代奴隶。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9284.02, "timestamp": "02:34:44", "text": "正确的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9286.67, "timestamp": "02:34:46", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9290.469, "timestamp": "02:34:50", "text": "而且，从历史的角度来看，呃，很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9293.91, "timestamp": "02:34:53", "text": "多年来，那些遭受压迫的人们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9296.59, "timestamp": "02:34:56", "text": "这个词开始使用"}]